{"id":"legacy-recipe-3b2b038a-d096-4f7d-a405-001fb1493795","version":1,"category":"roof-outdoor","when":"Existing roof recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Ventilated Mono-Pitch Roof 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"cover primary living pavilion\",\"target\":\"main-house\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"extend low eave over outdoor seating\",\"target\":\"covered-terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"direct visible downpipes and overflow away from entries\",\"target\":\"rain-garden\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"orient high clerestory edge toward pool and ocean views\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid low eaves over vehicle turning paths\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Slope the roof away from prevailing ocean winds where site geometry allows. Lift the high edge toward the principal view without exposing occupied rooms to direct afternoon sun. Use a continuous ventilated ridge and insect-screened clerestory gap. Extend deep eaves over glazed walls and covered outdoor living zones. Collect roof runoff in concealed gutters and route overflow to planted drainage. Keep the roof silhouette as one disciplined plane with restrained structural expression.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"roofPitch\",\"max\":20,\"min\":5,\"unit\":\"deg\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"eaveDepth\",\"max\":3.5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"ridgeVentHeight\",\"max\":0.9,\"min\":0.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.45},{\"key\":\"roofProjectionLength\",\"max\":28,\"min\":7,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":14},{\"key\":\"clerestoryBandHeight\",\"max\":1.5,\"min\":0.35,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.8},{\"key\":\"rainwaterTankCapacity\",\"max\":30000,\"min\":3000,\"unit\":\"L\",\"value\":12000},{\"key\":\"roofFinish\",\"value\":\"standing-seam-metal\",\"options\":[\"standing-seam-metal\",\"light-toned-tile\",\"composite-shingle\"]},{\"key\":\"ceilingFinish\",\"value\":\"timber-soffit\",\"options\":[\"timber-soffit\",\"painted-fiber-cement\",\"bamboo-lining\"]}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"tropical-envelope","version":1,"category":"envelope","when":"Hot humid coastal or island contexts.","title":"Caribbean climate and envelope","combinations":"Pair shaded glazing with sheltered outdoor living and selective screening.","placement":"Place openings for potential cross ventilation and shelter entrances from driving rain; orientation and wind are assumptions until supplied.","principles":"Prioritize shade, weather protection and maintainable coastal materials; request local hurricane and corrosion engineering.","capabilities":"Screens, overhangs and openings can be constructed; no wind, corrosion, thermal or hurricane certification.","construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["wall"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Screens, overhangs and openings can be constructed; no wind, corrosion, thermal or hurricane certification. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"legacy-recipe-15dd352f-73be-4803-a630-d590ba125c97","version":1,"category":"arrival","when":"Existing entry-sequence recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Driveway Threshold 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"form a clear vehicle approach from the site entry\",\"target\":\"driveway\"},{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"terminate on the protected pedestrian arrival route\",\"target\":\"entry\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"provide a direct branch before the main entry threshold\",\"target\":\"garage\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"use planting to screen parking and frame the approach\",\"target\":\"arrival-garden\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"coordinate low-glare guidance lighting along edges\",\"target\":\"lighting\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"keep vehicle circulation separate from pool access\",\"target\":\"pool\"}]","placement":"Align the approach toward a framed view of the entrance rather than the garage door. Use a widened turning bay that doubles as a discreet guest drop-off. Set the gate back from the property line to create a vehicle holding apron. Use permeable pale paving with a salt-resistant finish suitable for beach conditions. Layer palms and coastal planting at the edges without narrowing vehicle clearance. Keep bollards low, warm, and shielded from ocean-facing views. Separate the pedestrian route with a raised planted island or textured paving band.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"drivewayWidth\",\"max\":7.2,\"min\":4.8,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":5.8},{\"key\":\"arrivalLength\",\"max\":42,\"min\":14,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":24},{\"key\":\"turningDiameter\",\"max\":16,\"min\":9,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"pavingJointWidth\",\"max\":0.025,\"min\":0.006,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.012},{\"key\":\"permeablePaving\",\"unit\":\"boolean\",\"value\":true},{\"key\":\"pavingFinish\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"sand-toned-stone\",\"options\":[\"sand-toned-stone\",\"exposed-aggregate\",\"large-format-concrete\",\"coral-limestone\"]},{\"key\":\"gateType\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"recessed-sliding\",\"options\":[\"none\",\"recessed-sliding\",\"pivot-gate\",\"timber-screen-gate\"]},{\"key\":\"bollardSpacing\",\"max\":6,\"min\":3,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":4.5},{\"key\":\"arrivalLighting\",\"max\":35,\"min\":8,\"unit\":\"lux\",\"value\":18}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"legacy-recipe-21d1571a-86f7-4226-bb31-33b2677f13ec","version":1,"category":"climate-site","when":"Existing planting recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Poolside Planting Garden 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"along one or more non-access pool edges\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"visible from covered outdoor living areas\",\"target\":\"terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"screen service edges without blocking circulation\",\"target\":\"outdoor-kitchen\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"uplight selected palms and specimen foliage\",\"target\":\"lighting\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid dense planting at vehicle sightlines\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Layer palms, broadleaf understory, and low groundcover from back to front. Frame ocean or garden views rather than forming a continuous visual wall. Keep pool access paths and emergency egress clear. Use salt-tolerant species on exposed beach sites. Cluster boulders and sculptural plants as deliberate focal points. Conceal pool equipment and boundary edges with dense evergreen foliage. Maintain a restrained palette of repeated tropical species for a modern composition.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"bedDepth\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"canopyPalmSpacing\",\"max\":8,\"min\":3.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":5.5},{\"key\":\"understoryPlantDensity\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.5,\"unit\":\"plants/m²\",\"value\":2.8},{\"key\":\"groundcoverCoverage\",\"max\":95,\"min\":40,\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":72},{\"key\":\"featureBoulderCount\",\"max\":16,\"min\":0,\"unit\":\"count\",\"value\":5},{\"key\":\"pathClearance\",\"max\":2,\"min\":0.9,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":1.2},{\"key\":\"accentLighting\",\"unit\":\"boolean\",\"value\":true},{\"key\":\"plantingCharacter\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"layered-lush\",\"options\":[\"layered-lush\",\"sculptural-minimal\",\"coastal-resilient\"]}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
